Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 16:41:25 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] test(mokka-demo): add a mixed simulated GPU model scenario

hack/mokka-demo/mixed-gpus/run.sh runs demo.sh once per Mokka GPU
profile, each with its own node pool, node label and Mokka release, then
checks that each pool's nodes advertise their own GPU model and count and
that a pod selecting a model through nvidia.com/gpu.product lands on that
model's pool.

Signed-off-by: Benjamin Kero <bkero@nvidia.com>
